Cleft sentences are to be represented with the attribute '''@topic'''.

 It's money that I love. =  I love money.@topic
 It is Joey whom we are looking for. = We are looking for Joey.@topic
 It was from John that she heard the news. = She heard the news from John.@topic
 C'est Jean que je cherche = Je cherche Jean.@topic
 C'est à Paris que j'habite = J’habite à Paris.@topic